  "ui.055": "A place to return to",
  "ui.056": "<div class=\"home-goal\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">{0}</span><h3>{1}</h3><p>{2}</p></div>{3}</div><div class=\"milestones\">{4}</div><p class=\"muted\">Camp costs are split between a campfire (10 gold, 2 wood) and shelter (30 gold, 8 wood). Tap a blueprint, place it on the ground, rotate, then confirm. Keep doorways connected to the central path.</p><div class=\"building-grid\">{5}</div><h3>Already built</h3><div class=\"item-list\">{6}</div><div class=\"row\"><button data-action=\"undo\" {7}>Undo latest placement</button><button data-action=\"rest\" {8}>Rest · advance one day</button><button data-action=\"share-home\" {9}>Export stronghold image</button></div>",
