  "ui.068": "<p class=\"muted\">Nothing built yet. Start with your fire and shelter.</p>",
  "ui.069": "What the valley remembers",
  "ui.070": "STORIES · RING SIGHT · SYNERGIES",
  "ui.071": "<div class=\"journal-grid\"><article><h3>The six beacons</h3>{0}</article><article><h3>Six ways the rings answer</h3><p class=\"muted\">Each synergy requires both rings in the two active slots. Support slots and home sockets do not activate synergies. Secondary effects never trigger Echo or another synergy.</p>{1}<h3>Ring sight</h3><p>Ember ignites the marked brambles on Ashen Road. Dawnward makes the authored inscriptions speak through light. Frostwake turns rain-filled marked channels into optional crossings. Ordinary routes always lead to the objective.</p><h3>Our story</h3><p>{2}</p><button data-action=\"menu:challenge\" {3}>Challenge board</button><button data-action=\"menu:residents\">Speak with residents</button></article></div>",
  "ui.072": "<div class=\"journal-entry\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">CHAPTER {0} {1}</span><h3>{2}</h3><p>{3}</p><p class=\"lore\">{4}</p>{5}</div>",
  "ui.073": "<div class=\"journal-entry\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">{0}</span><h3>{1}</h3><b>{2}</b><p>{3}</p></div>",
  "ui.074": "COMBINATION CLUE",
  "ui.075": "The Ashen Regent has bound this valley to six dying beacons. You are no lord, and no prophecy waits for you. Begin by helping the person beside the road.",
  "ui.076": "Make yourself at home",
  "ui.077": "<div class=\"settings-grid\"><div><label>Difficulty<select data-setting=\"difficulty\">{0}</select></label><p class=\"muted\">Changing difficulty keeps all progress. Story reduces incoming damage; Veteran increases it.</p>{1}{2}<label>Visual quality<select data-setting=\"quality\"><option value=\"high\" {3}>High</option><option value=\"low\" {4}>Reduced resolution & weather</option></select></label></div><div><h3>Keyboard & pointer</h3><div class=\"bindings\">{5}</div><p class=\"muted\">WASD / arrows move. Pointer aims. Primary click attacks, secondary click uses your weapon art. Sword: hold to guard; press just before a hit to parry. Bow and axe: hold and release to charge. Basic attacks need no stamina.</p><h3>Your journey is yours</h3><p class=\"muted\">Autosaves after rewards and home changes. Reloading a boss resumes at its entrance. The last valid save is retained as a backup. Keep an export when moving browsers or devices.</p><div class=\"row\"><button data-action=\"export-save\">Export save</button><button data-action=\"import-save\">Import save</button><button data-action=\"restore-backup\">Restore backup</button><button data-action=\"restore-archive\">Previous journey</button></div><input type=\"file\" accept=\"application/json,.json\" id=\"save-import\" hidden><button data-action=\"share-loadout\">Export loadout image</button><div id=\"import-error\" class=\"error\"></div></div></div>",
