  "ui.096": "Keep the lights alive",
  "ui.097": "AFTER THE CAMPAIGN · LEVEL CAP 30",
  "ui.098": "<p>Return to familiar fights, explore missing caches, and finish your ring collection. Your home remains yours.</p><div class=\"row\"><button class=\"primary\" data-action=\"gauntlet\" {0}>Six-major-boss gauntlet</button><button data-action=\"defence\" {1}>Settlement defence · 3 waves</button></div><div class=\"stage-list\">{2}</div><p>Collection: {3}/12 rings · {4}/6 synergies · {5} caches recovered</p><h3>Earned cloak colours</h3><div class=\"row\">{6}</div>",
