  "ui.112": "Read the chronicle",
  "ui.113": "<p>Recover the first beacon at Rootbound Watch. Alda, the smith, is waiting for a safe road home.</p>",
  "ui.114": "<div class=\"boss-intro\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">{0} · STAGE {1}</span><h2>{2}</h2><p class=\"lore\">“{3}”</p><div class=\"boss-clue\"><small>WATCH FOR</small><p>{4}.</p></div><p class=\"muted\">Health and flasks restored. Death returns you to this entrance. Your recovered rewards are safe.</p><button class=\"primary\" data-action=\"fight\">Enter the arena</button><button data-action=\"return-home\">Return home</button></div>",
  "ui.115": "BEYOND THE CHECKPOINT",
  "ui.116": "<div class=\"boss-intro\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">{0}</span><h2>{1}</h2><p>{2}</p><p class=\"lore\">{3}.</p><button class=\"primary\" data-action=\"retry\">{4}</button><button data-action=\"return-home\">Return to the hearth</button></div>",
  "ui.117": "<div class=\"boss-intro\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">STAGE {0} COMPLETE · {1}</span><div class=\"victory-crest\">{2}</div><h2>{3}</h2><p>{4}</p><div class=\"reward-summary\"><b>Level {5}</b><span>{6}/30 stages restored</span><span>{7}/12 rings recovered</span></div>{8}<button class=\"primary\" data-action=\"return-home\">Return to the hearth</button>{9}<button data-action=\"explore-exit\">Walk to the exit</button></div>",
  "ui.118": "The rider retreats",
  "ui.119": "The valley breathes again",
  "ui.120": "A light returns",
  "ui.121": "The Nameless Nazgûl is driven back into the dark. It has not been destroyed.",
  "ui.122": " can hold this road no longer.",
  "ui.123": "<button data-action=\"gauntlet-next:{0}\">Next beacon · checkpoint {1}/6</button>",
  "ui.124": "<div class=\"boss-intro\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">THE LAST BEACON IS FREE</span><h2>{0}</h2><p>The ring-smith’s crown has fallen. Six lights wait for one final promise.</p><div class=\"ending-options\"><button data-action=\"ending:valley\"><b>{1}</b><p>Restore the roads and the distant windows. The valley shares the dawn.</p></button><button data-action=\"ending:hearth\"><b>{2}</b><p>Make your stronghold a bright refuge. Every lost traveller can find it.</p></button></div></div>",
