  "ui.133": "Made for a northern light",
  "ui.134": "<p>Original story, lesser rings, boss characters, dialogue, artwork and synthesised audio created for The Last Hearth.</p><p>Unofficial, non-canonical {0} fan concept set in {1}. Recognisable lore and creature names belong to their respective rightsholders. No endorsement is implied. No movie footage, film music, actor likenesses or extracted game assets are used.</p><p>Phaser 3.90.0 · Vite · TypeScript. See ASSET_CREDITS.md for asset provenance and dependency licences.</p><button data-action=\"title-close\">Return</button>",
